[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0010","text":"恭喜你，冬优子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0020","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0030","text":"你看，之前中间发表不是拿了第一名吗？\n想再正式跟你说一声"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0040","text":"啊，嗯……\n谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0050","text":"……比我想象中冷静啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0060","text":"那不是当然的吗\n从一开始就是冲着这个目标去的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0070","text":"当然，拿到第一名是很开心\n但是，这里不是终点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0080","text":"是啊……\n嗯，你说得对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0090","text":"接下来才是关键……\n可不能掉以轻心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0100","text":"嗯\n继续加油吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0110","text":"…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_1000","text":"SNS的帖子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0120","text":"『────好好纪念了一下☆\n　一起拍了照♡♡♡　#超要好』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0130","text":"（……\n　真会来事儿啊——）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0140","text":"……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0150","text":"……唉\n真做得出来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0160","text":"冬优子……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0170","text":"没什么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03180000_02_0180","text":"只是瞎想了些傻事……"}]
